# ---- R session / IDE ----
.Rproj.user/
.Rhistory
.RData
.RDataTmp
.Ruserdata

# ---- large external inputs: the two hub clones live OUTSIDE the repo ----
# (clone them next to this repo -- see README "Getting the hub data"); never vendored here.
hubs/
RespiCast-Covid19/
RespiCast-SyndromicIndicators/

# NOTE: output/ IS committed on purpose -- the derived tables (output/*.csv), the
# artefact data (output/artefact_data.json), the theme/audit synthesis and the PNG
# figures are all small and let the dashboard + docs reproduce WITHOUT re-cloning the
# 1.7 GB of hub submissions. They regenerate from source via code/00_main.R.

# ---- private survey microdata: NEVER commit to the public repo ----
# The full export contains open-text answers in which four respondents name their own
# country or institute. Only data/survey_public_notext.xlsx (free text blanked) is published.
data/survey_deidentified.xlsx

# The redaction script necessarily contains the list of names it removes, i.e. a
# codebook for reversing the redaction. It is kept private, alongside the full export.
code/02_survey/redact_public_outputs.R
